o-short text-gray-800 leading-relaxed","children":"For most Kenyan homes, a portable power station with an LFP battery (such as EcoFlow DELTA or BLUETTI) is the best blackout backup: it switches on silently, needs no fuel, runs indoors, and can be recharged from KPLC power or solar panels."}],[["$","p","Unlike a petrol generator there are no fumes, no noise and no fuel runs.",{"className":"mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Unlike a petrol generator there are no fumes, no noise and no fuel runs."}],["$","p","Unlike a traditional inverter with lead-acid batteries, LFP power stations last thousands of cycles and need no maintenance.",{"className":"mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Unlike a traditional inverter with lead-acid batteries, LFP power stations last thousands of cycles and need no maintenance."}]],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/power-stations","className":"mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:underline","children":["Compare power stations"," →"]}]]}],["$","article","what-size-power-station",{"id":"what-size-power-station","className":"scroll-mt-28 border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"What size power station do I need for my home in Kenya?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"aeo-short text-gray-800 leading-relaxed","children":"Add up the watts of everything you want to run, multiply by the hours you need them, and choose a power station whose capacity (Wh) is about 20% above that total and whose output (W) is above the combined load."}],[["$","p","Example: a fridge (~150 W) + TV (~100 W) + lights (~50 W) + Wi-Fi (~15 W) is about 315 W. For 6 hours that is roughly 1,900 Wh, so a 2,000–2,500 Wh unit is a good fit.",{"className":"mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Example: a fridge (~150 W) + TV (~100 W) + lights (~50 W) + Wi-Fi (~15 W) is about 315 W. For 6 hours that is roughly 1,900 Wh, so a 2,000–2,500 Wh unit is a good fit."}],["$","p","Batteriq will size a system for free — send your appliance list on WhatsApp (+254 716 822 014).",{"className":"mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Batteriq will size a system for free — send your appliance list on WhatsApp (+254 716 822 014)."}]],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/compare","className":"mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:underline","children":["Compare capacities"," →"]}]]}],["$","article","power-station-run-fridge",{"id":"power-station-run-fridge","className":"scroll-mt-28 border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"Can a power station run a fridge in Kenya?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"aeo-short text-gray-800 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes. Mid-size and larger EcoFlow DELTA and BLUETTI power stations run a household fridge for many hours, because a typical fridge only draws around 100–200 W once it is running."}],[["$","p","Choose a unit whose output is well above the fridge’s start-up surge; DELTA-class models handle this comfortably.",{"className":"mt-2 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Choose a unit whose output is well above the fridge’s start-up surge; DELTA-class models handle this comfortably."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","article","ups-function",{"id":"ups-function","className":"scroll-mt-28 border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2","children":"Can an EcoFlow power station work as a UPS during power cuts?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"aeo-short text-gray-800 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes. EcoFlow power stations support pass-through charging and switch over automatically when KPLC power drops, so Wi-Fi routers, desktops and CCTV keep running through a blackout."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","article","power-station-vs-generator",{"id":"power-station-vs-generator","className":"scroll-mt-28 bo